# Trivy CVE suppressions for the lore-server image.
#
# The container workflows (pr-container.yml, release-container.yml) scan
# the built image and FAIL on CRITICAL CVEs. To accept a specific CVE
# that is unreachable in our image (or for which no fix exists yet), add
# its ID below WITH a one-line justification and a date. Do not blanket-
# ignore — each entry is a deliberate, reviewed exception.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # why it's accepted / unreachable — name, YYYY-MM-DD
#
# (none yet)
